sorry to bother you with this - but since the issue is still unresolved, I would ask you to adjust the endElement-Method in org.apache.tika.sax.ToXMLContentHandler as follows.

    @Override
    public void endElement(String uri, String localName, String qName)
            throws SAXException {
        if (inStartElement) {
            write(&quot; /&gt;&quot;);
            inStartElement = false;
        } else {
            write(&quot;&lt;/&quot;);
            write(qName);
            write(&apos;&gt;&apos;);
        }
        // TIKA-1070 
        currentElement = currentElement.parent;
        namespaces.clear();
    } 

as initially posted the &quot;currentElement = currentElement.parent&quot; statement solves the issue

